te danger, and flip direction at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaa <strong>Grotesque minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From target crows to twisted timing tests: each challenge is unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f <strong>Hand-drawn intense art style</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, stylized look with surreal dark comic vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Lethal mistakes, high rewards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Limited lives, perfectionist scoring, and addictive replay loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Versatile Game Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for short but intense sessions, perfect for speedrunners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267b\ufe0f <strong>High replay value</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat levels faster, better, and with higher scores every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/extras/GIF_Gameplay_02.gif?t=1750503979\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What you can expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Top-down spinning puzzle gameplay \u2014 think fast, spin faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional grotesque minigames for bonuses and chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Power-ups that rewrite the rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local high score system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A surreal but readable hand-drawn style</p></li></ul>","developers":["IV Productions"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409660/b9c523490a779dd513ac893bb5396e977d717d37/header.jpg?t=1750503979","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name